+/*
+ * Preferred core of the current thread among all of the process's cores (its mask widened to the process's: libnx
+ * creates threads without core 3 even when the process has it). For core 3 when an exheader override gives it to the
+ * process; false (nothing changed) when the process does not have that core.
+ */
+bool RexSwitchPreferProcessCore(int core);
+
 /* Which core the calling thread is running on right now. It can only be asked about oneself. */
